     UNIX-like systems for the alpha (NetBSD) require SRM.  SRM is 
     available from ftp.digital.com (somewhere in there).
     
     Read the licenses related to using SRM to make sure that it is legal 
     for you to use, etc.
     
     SRM is specific to each alpha system, so make sure that if you go to 
     install SRM you install the right one.
     
